notes.content:
1. Warrior skills are adjusted, low-level skills are slightly weakened, but the role span of upgraded skills is increased.
2. Fix the bug that the connection of some handles will cause the game to report an error;
3. Fix the bug that if the Steam community window is opened when the game is paused, the pause will be cancelled;
4. Fix the bug that the sound effect disappears after the game runs for a while;
5. Fix the bug that may cause the game to report an error when picking up props;
6. Fix the bug that when all skills are fully upgraded, equipment rewards can still be obtained after upgrading again, resulting in infinite superposition of attributes;
7. Optimized picking up props in full screen;
8. Optimize the problem of uneven speed when the character moves on two axes (need to observe the effect further and make adjustments)
